10.10.8.73 80 closed/unreachable: TimeoutError
10.10.8.73 8080 closed/unreachable: TimeoutError
10.10.8.73 8088 closed/unreachable: TimeoutError
10.10.8.216 1521 OPEN
10.10.8.216 22 closed/unreachable: ConnectionRefusedError
```

